# Cursor quota

- Do not read or search `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `dev-dist/`, `.vite/`, `coverage/`.
- Do not load large WASM, sourcemaps (`*.map`), or test media into context.
- Prefer targeted greps over whole-repo reads.
- Keep rule files and prompts concise.
